      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout single\" data-layout=\"single\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"InstallingandConfiguringBahmniConnect-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni</span> has to be installed on the server and the <span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni Connect</span> app has to b<span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">e installed on the client (Chrome, Android, Desktop). Apart from the install steps, basic configuration required for syncing and upgrading the app is also detailed. </span></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout three-equal\" data-layout=\"three-equal\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"75cc2741-ab64-44c9-b537-0a202bfb8299\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Sections</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"28bbf201-d4bb-472c-865e-0ceb60581fb2\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535706/Installing+Bahmni+Connect+on+Server\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535706\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Installing Bahmni Connect on Server</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535723/Connect+Installation+Steps+on+Server\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535723\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Connect Installation Steps on Server</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535719/Server+Setup+For+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535719\" data-linked-resource-version=\"30\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Server Setup